---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+15805550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(580) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Weak AC Airflow — Ardmore OK Repair" description="Weak airflow from vents in Ardmore? Dirty filters, ducts, or blower issues fixed same day.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Weak Airflow</h1>
      <p>Reduced airflow strains your system and reduces comfort.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <p>If air from the vents feels weak, your system is working harder than it should. Restricted airflow is a leading cause of frozen coils and early component failure.</p>
      <h2>Common Causes</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Dirty or clogged air filters</li>
        <li>Blocked or leaking ducts</li>
        <li>Failing blower motor</li>
        <li>Dirty evaporator coil</li>
        <li>Closed or restricted registers</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Get Help Today</h2>
      <p>Call <a href={`tel:${phone}`}>{phoneDisplay}</a> for airflow diagnosis in Ardmore.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:1.5rem"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call Now — {phoneDisplay}</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
